    <othernotes>Roxanne is a new character exclusive to Freddy Fazbear's Mega Pizzaplex, a large family entertainment center owned by Fazbear Entertainment LLC. This modern line of animatronic performers is fitted with many technological innovations, including life-like AI programming, advanced facial recognition, and real-time connection to a criminal database to help security staff keep the creeps out.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Regarding rumors of the animatronics and/or the Pizzaplex being "haunted" by the ghosts of children, a "purple guy," and/or a "mimic," they are just that: rumors. Both the Glamrock animatronics and the Pizzaplex as a whole have seen no such kidnapping/murder/Springlock incidents and are completely free of any human remains.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;In addition to playing the keytar for the band, Roxanne is also the mascot for "Roxy Raceway," a go-karting attraction, as well as the Glamrock Beauty Salon. She also makes minor appearances in other attractions, such as Fazer Blast laser tag and Monty's Gator Golf.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Fazbear Entertainment LLC is not liable for any physical or emotional injuries that may occur while playing strip poker with Roxanne Wolf, or any damage to personal property such as clothing or personal electronic devices, including but not limited to phones and smart watches. Tampering with the animatronic voids any and all Parts &amp; Service rights.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ways to connect with your Roxanne Wolf unit:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;As previously mentioned, Roxanne can play the keytar. Her playing is for real, thanks to the advanced technology in her hands, so she can give out tips on playing.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Please note that due to Roxanne's enhanced visual sensors, she may occasionally comment on details that are very difficult -- or impossble -- to see with the human eye.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;She is also a fan fashion, including hair, makeup, and clothing. Wanting everyone to look their best, Roxanne will happily critique a person's looks.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Being the mascot of Roxy Raceway, Roxanne enjoys talking about racing and vehicle maintenence. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;To go with the museum-like nature of the Pizzaplex, Roxanne comes pre-installed with all sorts of fun facts about previous Fazbear Entertainment LLC establishments throughout the ages, as well as their unique animatronic variantions.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Remember, any unsavory rumors about hauntings, animatronic glitches, the "Bite of 87," the "Missing Children Incident," et cetera, are merely the result of slander perpetuated by a rogue game developer. Roxanne does not have any information regarding these supposed events.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;As an added level of security for Pizzaplex patrons, the Glamrock animatronics are equipped with facial recognition technology, which allows them to scan faces and compare them to a criminal database. If Roxanne incorrectly flags you as a criminal, please contact the nearest Fazbear Engineer for assistance.</othernotes>
